'ACCOUNTINGASST./AUDIT ASSOCIATE/MERCHANDISING RELI - Casablanca', 'Comptabilite/Gestion/Audit/Finance', 'Accounting Assistant position 1. University Graduate preferably Bachelor’s Degree in Accounting, Finance or related field. 2. With a Minimum of two (2) years demonstrated experience in data analysis and reporting. 3. Proficiency with Microsoft Office (word, Excel, PowerPoint, Excel). 4. Self-directed. 5. Ability to communicate findings and make recommendations. 6. Strong critical, conceptual and analytical thinking is essential. 7. Details oriented. 8. Flexibility and Adaptability. 9. Ability to work independently with general supervision. 10. Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English, French and Arabic Merchandising Assistant-Reliever • Background in Business, Marketing, or Merchandising • Minimum of three (3) years of relevant experience • Basic understanding of financial statements • Strong teamwork and interpersonal skills • High attention to detail Can able to communicate well in English (written and oral) Associate Auditor Skills and Competencies 1. University degree graduate in Finance, Accounting, Business Management or any degree with Auditing education, training and practices. 2. Proficient in verbal and written communication skills using English (is a must), French and/ or Arabic languages. 3. Ability to multitask, prioritize and meet deadlines effectively. 4. Cooperatively works with the Team. 5. Keen to details and provides clear and timely information. 6. Skillful in the use of basic computer programs, internet, photocopy machine and other office equipment. 7. Understand office protocol and help maintain them.', 'Anapec', 'Casablanca', 'Bac plus 4'
